# Route: guide 38 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Tauren
# (1211 of 1222 eligible quests, 160.2 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 56 to
# 58, 35 quests, 3.3 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Ashenvale, Thunder Bluff, Feralas, Stranglethorn Vale, Badlands,
# Searing Gorge): Fallen Sky Lake -> Raynewood Retreat -> The Zoram Strand ->
# Night Run -> Felfire Hill -> near Thunder Bluff -> Thunder Bluff -> Camp
# Mojache -> Feral Scar Vale -> Grimtotem Compound -> Camp Mojache -> The Twin
# Colossals -> The Forgotten Coast -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Allegiance to the Old Gods (6564;
# Blackfathom Tide Priestess 20-21); The Star, the Hand and the Heart (736;
# Grel'borg the Miser 39, Dagun the Ravenous 43, Mogh the Undying 44); Broken
# Alliances (793; Blacklash 50, Hematus 50).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Blackfathom Villainy (6561), Allegiance to the Old Gods
# (6565), Allegiance to the Old Gods (6565), Amongst the Ruins (6921), Amongst
# the Ruins (6921), Baron Aquanis (6922), Leaders of the Fang (914),
# Compendium of the Fallen (1049), A Vengeful Fate (1102), Testing an Enemy's
# Strength (5723), Pusillin and the Elder Azj'Tordin (7441), Elven Legends
# (7481), Lethtendris's Web (7489), Find the Gems and Power Source (2339),
# Disharmony of Fire (3907), Commander Gor'shak (3981), The Rise of the
# Machines (4063), KILL ON SIGHT: Dark Iron Dwarves (4081), KILL ON SIGHT:
# High Ranking Dark Iron Officials (4082), Operation: Death to Angerforge
# (4132), Lost Thunderbrew Recipe (4134), Ribbly Screwspigot (4136), The Pack
# Mistress (4724), Kibler's Exotic Pets (4729), The Darkstone Tablet (4768),
# En-Ay-Es-Tee-Why (4862), Warlord's Command (4903), Operative Bijou (4981),
# Blackhand's Command (7761), The Left Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet
# (8966), The Left Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet (8967), The Left Piece of
# Lord Valthalak's Amulet (8968), The Left Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet
# (8969), The Right Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet (8989), The Right Piece
# of Lord Valthalak's Amulet (8990), The Right Piece of Lord Valthalak's
# Amulet (8991), The Right Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet (8992), Mea Culpa,
# Lord Valthalak (8995).

